  "body": "**4 Bedrooms | 3 Bathrooms | 3 Living Areas | Great Garden**\r\n\r\nIf space is what you’re looking for, **263 West Hoe Heights, Orewa** deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs living area can also be utilised as an additional bedroom, making it an ideal option for larger households requiring extra sleeping space.\r\n\r\nThis generously proportioned home offers **four large bedrooms, three bathrooms and an impressive three living areas**, giving the whole family plenty of room to spread out. Whether you need separate spaces for the kids, a home office, a media room or simply enjoy having room to entertain, the layout provides plenty of flexibility.\r\n\r\nThe **large bedrooms** are a real highlight, while the multiple living areas make everyday family life that much easier.\r\n\r\nOutside, you’ll find a **good-sized garden area** with plenty of potential for children, pets, gardening or simply enjoying the outdoors.\r\n\r\n Property Features:\r\n\r\n* 4 generously sized bedrooms\r\n* 3 bathrooms\r\n* 3 separate living areas\r\n* Spacious and flexible floorplan\r\n* Good garden and outdoor space\r\n* Plenty of room for families and entertaining\r\n* Popular Orewa location\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of **bedroom size, bathrooms and multiple living spaces** are not always easy to find.\r\n\r\n**Come along and see how much space 263 West Hoe Heights has to offer.**",
